config MAGIC_WAND_INFERENCE_STRIDE
	int "Samples between inferences"
	default 1
	range 1 10
	help
	  Run inference every this many accelerometer samples, once the
	  128-sample window is full. 1 matches upstream: an inference per
	  sample, at 25 Hz. Raise it if the "Magic Wand ready" line reports an
	  inference slower than a sample period (40 ms); the gesture predictor's
	  suppression scales with it.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
